{"id":"dolzhen","lemma":"должен","pos":"adj","rank":77,"glosses":["must, have to","owe"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Почему ты должен умереть?","en":"Why do you have to die?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728318","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to die of natural causes"}]},{"text":"Я должен купить одну.","en":"I must buy one.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653960","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to buy, to purchase"},null]},{"text":"Ты должен пойти туда немедленно.","en":"You must go there immediately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267781","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to go"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"immediately"}]},{"text":"Что я должен делать?","en":"What must I do?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Я сейчас должен это сделать?","en":"Must I do it now?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]}]}